Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie Bradbury\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie Bradbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.85,0:00:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩儿们 最近好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.85,0:00:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个高中辍学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does a high school dropout become.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是怎么变成罗曼公司最聪明的员工的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the brightest minds at Roman Inc.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.31,0:00:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据以前的情况 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Historically, I have had this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不怎么尊重当权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem with authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有一种怪物吸附体一类的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there such a thing as monster magnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候变得这么专业的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you become such an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you guys left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.67,0:00:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就开始找各种各样的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dug into all things monstrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.19,0:00:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点着迷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a wee bit obessesive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.41,0:00:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这次是这么个用法\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a wee bit, completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,读猎魔 和真正猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big difference between reading about hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And actually hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.97,0:00:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…I'm more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.91,0:00:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是个初学者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunter-in-training.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不值得你动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally not worth killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you really should come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.09,0:00:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我去基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And dig through our archives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.53,0:00:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝对是女学者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are definitely a woman of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.41,0:00:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是全地球最安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just the safest place on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.26,0:00:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,能隔离一切邪恶生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warded against any evil ever created.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.11,0:00:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,具有有关超自然的丰富宝库\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the supernatural mother lode.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.49,0:00:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果知识就是力量的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If knowledge is power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.83,0:00:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这就是地球上最强大的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the most powerful place on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.94,0:00:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam 我们找到栖息地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I think we found the bat cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.83,0:01:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对接完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protocol's complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.36,0:01:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫James\N{\fnArial\fs30}James.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- James Haggerty - Peter Jenkins\N{\fnArial\fs30}- James Haggerty - Peter Jenkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.81,0:01:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做的都对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we do everything right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.59,0:01:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.88,0:02:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,建这个垃圾堆居然花了三年时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took three years to build this dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.24,0:02:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,垃圾堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.98,0:02:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,垃圾堆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.24,0:02:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们在哪儿吗 这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize where we are.This.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.48,0:02:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这乌七八糟的世界里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This dump is the last true beacon of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.55,0:02:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方是光明的基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}In world gone topsy-turvy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.53,0:02:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个垃圾堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.83,0:02:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是正义与邪恶斗争的中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the epicentre of the ultimate chess match between good and evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.60,0:02:35.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（六个月后）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是垃圾堆一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我想到什么了吗 这次的任务 我本来以为是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I got?This assignment I thought they'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也说不清 应该很兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know…Excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.75,0:02:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是次刺激的冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.91,0:02:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒险不是什么好事 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing worse an adventure my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.45,0:02:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.20,0:02:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,外线765\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extention 765.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.87,0:02:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.22,0:03:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the password.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是有协议的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's protocol here, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.20,0:03:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会等\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.53,0:03:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了一位客人 是个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a guest, damn hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.62,0:03:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank's kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.75,0:03:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对她所作的一切 真是太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he did for her?That was really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.22,0:03:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他确实很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was something all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我天 真的是你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy bucket, it's really you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.01,0:03:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 真的是我 新手\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, rookie, it's really me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.56,0:03:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Dorothy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.78,0:03:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两位谁愿意帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of you genuises is gonna help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.84,0:03:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了西方坏女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me to kill the wicked witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.15,0:04:00.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.77,0:04:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 大麋鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要更多恶魔名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want more demon names.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.79,0:04:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要一间观景房\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna a room with a view.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.51,0:04:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以讨论啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can discuss this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.17,0:04:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我伸个腿也行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd settle for streching my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.20,0:04:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ballocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.49,0:04:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.29,0:04:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd it go with Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.65,0:04:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小书呆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little nerd is in a.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.35,0:04:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在Branson一个温馨的小旅馆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely warm motel room in Branson.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.17,0:04:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有48小时可以看付费黄片\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got about 48 hours of pay-per-porn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.99,0:04:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有Kenny Rogers的歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Kenny Rogers ahead of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.39,0:04:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他什么感受 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's he feeling? - Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.18,0:05:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他盯着天使预言板\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stared the angle tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.98,0:05:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路上一直念着falafe\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeated the word 'falafe' being the entire ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子累坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid cracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.69,0:05:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望小休假能让他 清醒清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope he's break will…clear his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在发生了那么多以后 我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know after eveything that happened I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.98,0:05:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也能休个假什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can use a little breaker ourselves.So.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.47,0:05:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你买了权力游戏第一季\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pick you up season 1 Game of Thrones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再叫个外卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think we can get a little of take out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 先说 我觉得我找到帮Cass的方法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well first, I think might to find a way yo help Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.39,0:05:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他聊过了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.50,0:05:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.43,0:05:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.38,0:05:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不理解他为什么不留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I so don't understand why him left in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地明显是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean the bucker is the.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,最安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safest place for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bartholomew之流 不知道还有多少天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bartholomew and who knows how many other angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.85,0:05:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在外面等着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are out there, gunning for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.87,0:05:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.59,0:05:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人比我更想让他在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody wants him here more than I do, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.81,0:05:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.69,0:05:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得他会给我们带来麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He felt like he bring trouble down on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.35,0:05:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he had to split.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有办法 我洗耳恭听\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you get a way to help, I'm all ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.05,0:05:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin说有工作台在天使坠天那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin said the table lit up like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,像圣诞树一般亮了起来 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Chistmans tree when the angel's fell, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.45,0:05:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以呢 - 所以我发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - So it turns out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.07,0:05:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个亮点都代表一群天使坠落的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each light was where a cluster of angels fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就想 也许有办法能\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm thinking, maybe there's some way to hotwire this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.99,0:06:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,能追查到天使行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe can track angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.72,0:06:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就能帮Cass了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way we can help Cass to clear danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你想出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was…your idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到这里有其他人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see anybody else in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how would it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.11,0:06:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没想好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始我觉得那堆工作台都是电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}See at the first I thought this table was a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.86,0:06:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面发现不是 这只是一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not.It turns out just a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.72,0:06:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我在下面发现了这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did find these cables underneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.20,0:06:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我跟过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I followed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定不相信我发现了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're never gonna believe what I've found.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voila.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.08,0:06:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是电脑吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is a computer? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.65,0:06:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是1951年时装上去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was in 1951 when it was installed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.61,0:06:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,才是诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the crazy thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,它完全不用插电\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not plugged in anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.86,0:06:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不知道它是如何工作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea what's making these thing work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是热的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's warm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.55,0:07:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.00,0:07:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来真简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that looks simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.16,0:07:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有说明书吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it come with a manual.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,档案里没有记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing on the archieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.26,0:07:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在网上也找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And obviously couldn't find anything like it online.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 我十分确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention I'm pretty sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.45,0:07:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候学者基地没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the men of letters doesn't exactly have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.28,0:07:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,计算机支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}IT support anymore, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认识的人里 有人能帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think if you know someboday can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.86,0:07:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.36,0:08:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么想说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you have to say for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.21,0:08:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我把她舌头割掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, I cut out her tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.93,0:08:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把她束缚住了 但不会坚持很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've bound her, but it won't last.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你抓住了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you captured her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.07,0:08:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All by your self.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.21,0:08:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 尽管我是个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, despite all my lady parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是自己抓住了西方坏女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I managed to capture the wicked witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲会很骄傲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father would be very proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.77,0:08:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道他 - 他总是在跟我讲废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you know - Waste my time with his word.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.23,0:08:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是不像他那样的话 我会很高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd appreciate it if you didn't do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在说正事儿 我试过砍她的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I have tried cutting off her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.47,0:08:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,放火烧她 用圣水浇她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burning her, dousing her with holy water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她唯一的反应就是大笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}All she did was laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.24,0:08:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道的方法都杀不死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing I know of can kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我找到你们 做最后一搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm here as a last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.66,0:08:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你们有方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping you stiffs have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死从绿野仙踪里来的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A way to kill someone from Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当然有方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.65,0:08:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我们必须有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.93,0:08:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是最后的灯塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is the last true beacon of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别废话了 赶紧去啃你们那堆破书吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, just open your damn book already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.34,0:08:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 Jenkins\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, Jenkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.19,0:09:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们开工了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.12,0:09:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你能过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小事一桩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是正赶上我刚被炒鱿鱼的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially since I got fired last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.10,0:09:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?What happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.80,0:09:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我工作的那家公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out the company I work for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.49,0:09:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在向外承包童工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was outsourcing to child labour.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.33,0:09:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.47,0:09:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就把这件事情抖了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took a big wikileak all over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,后果可想而知\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这样也挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cool, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我有时间发展个人爱好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me more time for my hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真人游戏RPG 编编花边儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larping, macrame.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.11,0:09:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有猎魔什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.89,0:09:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.90,0:09:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是几个小案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's just a couple of little cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干掉了一只小吸血鬼和一只鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took down a teenage vampire and a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.18,0:09:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来可能有点儿像少年文学小说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which sounds like a Y.A. novel if you say it out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完成的顺利吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.17,0:09:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点儿困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:09:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前一直觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.36,0:10:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎魔应该是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting was more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,更奇幻一点儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magical, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.74,0:10:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.85,0:10:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你们那台克门多尔64在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where is this Commodore 64 of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的Ada Lovelace啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet Ada Lovelace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.25,0:10:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西应该放进博物馆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing belongs in a museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.07,0:10:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,它居然有一个解码软件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's got encryption software.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且看上去它的能源来自某种奇妙的魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems to be powered by something magical.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.13,0:10:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接说结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skip to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.55,0:10:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种报警机制\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of an alarm system.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.05,0:10:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球毁灭性灾难 是很瘆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Global badness?It freaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.43,0:10:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这台电脑会锁住这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This computer is what locked this place down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.10,0:10:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能用它追踪天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we use it to track angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.83,0:10:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.23,0:10:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽我所能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.35,0:11:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.90,0:11:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然花费了点儿时间 但是现在都搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took some doing but now we can download.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.98,0:11:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这台怪兽保存着学者们所有的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}This beast has all the Men of Letters files.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候挪挪咱们的鼠标了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for a little drag-and-drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.98,0:11:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个好的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.23,0:11:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.21,0:11:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你一直在猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've been hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.98,0:11:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.86,0:11:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.88,0:11:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人猎魔违反了邪恶力量小说里的猎人守则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a good idea according to the Supernatural books.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.57,0:11:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不能帮我们把那些书从网上删掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really can't delete those from the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.52,0:11:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人能做到完全删除\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.31,0:11:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么小气嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}But come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.57,0:11:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟是在什么地方找到这些书的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you even find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个秘密基地 我管它叫亚马逊购物商城\N{\fnArial\fs30}The top secret place I call Amazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.93,0:11:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人把未出版部分也发到网上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And someone uploaded all the unpublished works.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.43,0:11:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始我还以为是同人小说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was fanfic at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来发现真的是Edlund的原著\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was clearly Edlund's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.22,0:11:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是谁上传的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who uploaded it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.29,0:11:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人的网名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their screen name was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Beckywinchester176\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beckywinchester176.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.40,0:11:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,想起什么人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ring a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.99,0:12:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 完全没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}None, nobody's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.39,0:12:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点儿想法都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there're no bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.91,0:12:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些文件都加密了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These files are encrypted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.19,0:12:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,要全解开得花点儿时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么接下来 叫点儿外卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, takeout.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.93,0:12:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起熬个夜 互相编个辫子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleepover, braid each other's hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.57,0:12:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.08,0:12:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小国王Joffery真不是个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow that Joffery's a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.50,0:12:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完全想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.52,0:12:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, until he.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.00,0:12:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别剧透\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spoilers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.63,0:12:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,书我还没看完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't read all the books yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.88,0:12:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放着电视不看 去看书吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna read the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.77,0:12:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 Dean 我就是喜欢看书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Dean, I like to read books.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.46,0:12:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是没有图片的一堆字儿 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the ones without pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 这床跟板儿砖一样硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, this bed is as comfortable as a brick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,打算什么时候搬进来住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any plans on moving in anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.50,0:12:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经搬进来了 这就是我的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am moved in, this is just my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.21,0:12:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is his style.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真抱歉 我还没挂起那张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sorry, I haven't hung up the.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.01,0:12:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住啊 喵仔 主题的海报 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hang in there, kitty"poster yet, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.61,0:12:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你随便挂什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel free to redecorate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.22,0:12:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 咱家配不上你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, our home's not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,喵仔海报吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the "Hang in there, kitty"poster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:12:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿不是咱们的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.78,0:12:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿只是咱们工作的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where we work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.25,0:13:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.13,0:13:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去多拿点儿啤酒过来怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go get us some more beers.How about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.12,0:13:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 Charlie\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,能跟我讲讲你为什么觉得猎魔不神奇了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was al that about how hunting isn't magical.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.10,0:13:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助别人 杀魔除怪 家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving people, hunting things, family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我表示理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.79,0:13:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是读着Tolkienn奇幻小说长大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was raised on Tolkien, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小说里写的那些都去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, where is all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.43,0:13:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的异鬼都去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are my White Walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.94,0:13:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的火山和魔戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my volcano and magic ring to throw in the damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.43,0:13:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.82,0:13:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的冒险去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is my quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法 冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic, quests.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.74,0:13:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都很艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.18,0:13:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.44,0:13:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.70,0:13:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,死路一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.08,0:13:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么办法都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing but dead ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.27,0:13:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有方法能杀掉这东西啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be some way to kill this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jenkins 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenkins, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿有一样属于我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something here that belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.13,0:14:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它交还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.68,0:14:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她到底在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's it talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.98,0:14:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有实验室吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.66,0:14:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,二楼 28号房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second floor, room 28.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.58,0:14:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.11,0:14:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jenkins Jenkins\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenkins!Jenkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.24,0:14:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you are in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jenkins早没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenkins is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.25,0:14:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jenkins\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.25,0:14:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.10,0:14:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有比冒险更糟的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing worse than adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.29,0:14:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dorothy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dorothy你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.76,0:15:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,下载应该都好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dowload should be done by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam 帮我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.40,0:16:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的个天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.91,0:16:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这所学者基地研究的第一个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first case investigated in this bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.50,0:16:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟Dorothy有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Involved Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.65,0:16:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她带着女巫来到这间屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She and the witch came into this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.05,0:16:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却再也没有出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they never came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.92,0:16:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事儿我永远也忘不掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This would never stop blowing my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动 托托（绿野仙踪里的宠物狗）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, pace yourself, Toto.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.10,0:16:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么会是真的 那是童话故事的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is this real, it's part of the fairy world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们必须找到她 - 不 在采取任何行动之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have to find her - No we have to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.48,0:16:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before anyone does anything, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.25,0:16:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dorothy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.91,0:16:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.49,0:16:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,典型的学者口吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Typical Men of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.77,0:16:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,假模事事的围过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.56,0:16:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,文绉绉的谈上半天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having a nice little chat with your noses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.18,0:16:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边把脸埋进你们的书里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buried in your books.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.49,0:16:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边让你们的小秘书记笔记\N{\fnArial\fs30}While your little secretary takes notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.01,0:16:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管谁叫小秘书呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who you're calling a secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.01,0:16:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是秘书吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're not the sacretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.97,0:16:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你是女学者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a Women of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.54,0:16:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底被封印了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have I been out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.92,0:16:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以咱们需要谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经被封印了75年之久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you've been gone for over 75 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.54,0:16:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据这些资料来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to our files.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.67,0:17:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿是为了杀死西方坏女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came here to kill the wicked witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但随后就失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.37,0:17:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.66,0:17:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法杀死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We couldn't find a way to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.08,0:17:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就做了我能做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I did the only thing that I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱俩得耗上一辈子了 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you and me forever, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.44,0:17:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dorothy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.87,0:17:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dorothy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个束缚咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}A binding spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}That came at a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和她灵魂束缚在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her soul with mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这些年来 你都和那个女巫困在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've been frozen with a witch for all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.28,0:17:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.47,0:17:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫是杀不死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The witch cannot be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.54,0:17:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我逃脱了咒语 那她也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm away and so is she.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.69,0:18:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好呀 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.05,0:18:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条线被下了防魔咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}This little box is worded against everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.34,0:18:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,西方坏女巫也不例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even wicked witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.04,0:18:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是您的大粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别喜欢您的创意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.70,0:18:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.46,0:18:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆小的狮子把你的舌头咬掉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cowardly Lion got your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈心谈够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough chitchat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.94,0:18:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿肯定是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be here for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.77,0:18:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,写下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Write it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.09,0:18:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能帮你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So daddy can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 如果她在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait if she's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为什么不杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't she kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她杀不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.81,0:18:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被北方好女巫的吻保护了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's protected by the Witch of the North's kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.61,0:18:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,书里写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.53,0:18:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了那些破书吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.63,0:18:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不值一提\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被保护了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.81,0:18:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the witch came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.04,0:18:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在找什么东西 我完全没有头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for something I have no idea what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以咱们必须在她得逞之前找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have to find her before she finds it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.53,0:18:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.12,0:19:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie你去那些资料里找找看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie dig into the files see if you could find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.35,0:19:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有什么方法能杀死女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}That puts a dent in a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.03,0:19:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam和我去四处查看一下 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and I will look and see, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.08,0:19:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.87,0:19:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怀疑这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.60,0:19:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在 你还是留下歇一歇\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for right now, why don't you rest up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.95,0:19:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便帮帮屋子里最聪明的那个人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And help the smartest person in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.35,0:19:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是大粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.55,0:19:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大魔法师奥兹人怎么样 - 是个大混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's the Wizard of Oz - It's a total ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在书里要温和多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were much nicer in the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些书就是个悲哀老头的胡言乱语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those books are the ravings of a sad old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲的胡言乱语\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸是L Frank Baum吗 书的作者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad was L.Frank Baum, the writer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.19,0:19:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时还是个学者\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Men of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是另一个光荣的图书馆管理员 你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another glorified libarian, you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.75,0:19:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.69,0:19:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙可能有些性别歧视\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guysmay have been sexist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们都非常聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}But like all libarians, they're wicked smart, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你第一次来的时候看见的那个男人 Haggerty\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dude who was here when you came in, Haggerty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直留着你的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kept your case filed opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到退休之前 都在研究那个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worked it everyday until he retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:19:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 他没能找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously he'd never found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你花点时间读一读这些资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you took five seconds to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.53,0:20:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会发现他找到了打败西方坏女巫的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did find a way to fight the wicked witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得第一部里面的罂粟花田吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember the Poppy fields in the first book.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实跟书里写的大相径庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's actually not how it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,更血腥一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was much bloodier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.54,0:20:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别再毁我童年了好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop ruining my childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.89,0:20:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得那些罂粟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember the poppies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.76,0:20:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Haggerty和一个仙子做了交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haggerty made a deal with a fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.92,0:20:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,得到了一些罂粟花提取物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And got some poppy extract.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.88,0:20:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用几把枪做点儿小改动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get some bullet from the gun range.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.99,0:20:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,做一些罂粟子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And make some poppy bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.35,0:20:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.92,0:20:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不要一起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you coming or what.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.00,0:20:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,来的可不是稻草人和铁皮人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it isn't the Scarecrow and the Tin Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.19,0:20:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们那位新来的客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your new house guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.84,0:20:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是被误解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.23,0:20:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看见她干坏事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither of you saw wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对你说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.39,0:21:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something along the lines of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.07,0:21:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去拿点圣油和打火机\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm gonna get some holy oil and a lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,老混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.51,0:21:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她在找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what she's looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does she want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be happy to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.97,0:21:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我更愿意活动活动我的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I get to stretch my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.26,0:21:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.40,0:21:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女巫到底想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does the witch want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.11,0:21:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.35,0:21:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没遛跶够呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still need to air myself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.75,0:21:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你已经活动够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you've aired out enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.28,0:22:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真粗鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.31,0:22:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Key.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.00,0:22:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}What key.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.75,0:22:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't the foggiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.45,0:22:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须在她杀了我之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to send her off a merry chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.18,0:22:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她支开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before she could melt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.54,0:22:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉她 你们把钥匙藏在了厨房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told her you boys kept the keys in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.86,0:22:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的确有间厨房 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do have a kitchen in this crap, don't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.11,0:22:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋 我才刚打扫过这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it I just cleaned it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.24,0:22:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.90,0:22:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以女巫来过这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we got a witch here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.64,0:22:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我们改装了你们的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry we raided your gun range.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.71,0:22:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,做了一些罂粟子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made us some poppy bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.35,0:22:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不足以杀死女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't kill the witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.20,0:22:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是够她好受的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they will stun the crap out of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.39,0:22:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我的好女孩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.65,0:22:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,材料只够做四枚子弹 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only enough for four bullets, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.98,0:22:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,射得准点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make each shot count.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.30,0:22:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在咱们只需要赶紧找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we'll just have to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.23,0:23:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她找到她想要的东西之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before she finds whatever the hell she's looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.47,0:23:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在找一把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's looking for a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.53,0:23:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.10,0:23:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鸟传的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little birdie told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.40,0:23:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有想起什么线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ring any bells Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.87,0:23:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.77,0:23:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是通往奥兹的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the key to Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.02,0:23:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多方法可以通往奥兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There're magical ways into Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.39,0:23:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙卷风 台风眼 或者大漩涡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tornado, eye of a hurricane, whirlpool.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.44,0:23:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这把钥匙能让所有大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this key will turn any locked door.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.12,0:23:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,统统大开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into a portal to Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.57,0:23:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,插入钥匙 转动 只需一眨眼的功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insert key, twisted, and presto.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.57,0:23:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就能到达奥兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.63,0:23:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,学者是怎么拿到那把钥匙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did the Men of Letters get the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.32,0:23:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.72,0:23:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果她找到了钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if she finds it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.16,0:23:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定会回到奥兹 完成她的阴谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll go back and finish what she started.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.10,0:23:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会毁了奥兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll destroy all that is good in Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.25,0:23:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有女巫军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got armies of witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.20,0:23:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,会飞的猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flying monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.65,0:23:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有很多人因此死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.81,0:23:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙长什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this key look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.23,0:23:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过这把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen that key.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.78,0:23:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在整理目录的时候看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found it when I was doing inventory.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.41,0:23:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,它现在在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.61,0:23:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的卧室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My room.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.97,0:23:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要马上去找到那把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get to that key.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.62,0:23:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie和我去我的卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, Charlie and I will go look into my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.89,0:23:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩给我们争取点儿时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you guys buy us some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.53,0:24:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.18,0:24:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿最安全的地方 是一个地牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safest place in this joint, is a dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.02,0:24:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们居然还有地牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a dungeon in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.80,0:24:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 你们当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.68,0:24:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你也许应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.87,0:24:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.36,0:24:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是藏在地牢里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially in a dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.96,0:24:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,西方坏女巫 神秘的钥匙 一个大冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wicked witch, a key, a quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.25,0:24:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定不能错过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.34,0:24:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Char-Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.91,0:24:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信我在这儿待了75年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe I've lived here for 75 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.46,0:24:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们管这地方叫家有多长时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you called this place home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.20,0:24:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥把这儿当家\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother calls it home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.55,0:24:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我 家对我来说可不是什么好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, I…don't have that much luck with homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.48,0:24:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.92,0:24:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,家总是没有想象中那么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overrated, if you asked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.20,0:24:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条金砖小路给了我逃离家的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yellow bricks or not gives me the open road any day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.28,0:24:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.69,0:24:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从那里面能去任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can get any where from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.13,0:25:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,分头行动 更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slip up, cover more ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.71,0:25:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然把色情小说整理得那么整齐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep your porn meticulously organized, but not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.91,0:25:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别评论我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't judge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.17,0:25:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yahtzee.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.12,0:25:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.46,0:25:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.99,0:26:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.66,0:26:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.30,0:26:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.83,0:26:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.65,0:26:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.16,0:26:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.38,0:26:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Zeke\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.55,0:26:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得帮帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.59,0:26:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.73,0:26:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 但你可以救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.70,0:26:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你救Cass那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what you did with Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.56,0:26:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能经常这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't keep doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.57,0:26:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.33,0:26:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的力量还没有恢复到一半 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm barely back to half strength, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.62,0:26:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次我使用能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I use my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.61,0:26:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会使我更虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It weakens me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.52,0:26:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就意味着我需要在你弟弟身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means I have to stay in your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.54,0:26:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,待更久的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Longer than you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.89,0:26:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你我都不愿看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Longer than we both want.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.38,0:26:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.90,0:26:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个在基地里的女巫力量非常强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running around your bunker is very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.79,0:27:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你们杀死女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help with the witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.21,0:27:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者救你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or save your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.65,0:27:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.51,0:27:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如你所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.09,0:27:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.26,0:27:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.30,0:27:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.07,0:27:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是告诉你要藏在地牢里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to stay in the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.18,0:27:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你对所有姑娘都这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you say that to all the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.68,0:27:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.03,0:27:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.88,0:27:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.00,0:27:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.11,0:27:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫出现了 要对我施咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The witch was about to put a whammy on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.40,0:27:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是Charlie跳起来保护了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Charlie jumped in front.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.05,0:27:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就中招了 然后女巫把你也放倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got zapped, then the witch got the drop on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.26,0:28:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们怎么没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why aren't we dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.62,0:28:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,问的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.68,0:28:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.89,0:28:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用罂粟子弹吓跑了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I clipped her with a with a poppy bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.66,0:28:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她拿走了钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.49,0:28:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她已经走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.12,0:28:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.81,0:28:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should still have some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.62,0:28:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能还藏在排气管道里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could still be in the air vents.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.09,0:28:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 她说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.28,0:28:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.16,0:28:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们先走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.74,0:28:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们随后就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.74,0:28:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的枪在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My gun's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.55,0:28:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就剩一颗子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one bullet in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.66,0:28:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们现在能做好朋友了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we be best friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.98,0:28:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Zeke是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.57,0:28:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.79,0:28:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跑进你房间的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I came into your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.07,0:28:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我被放倒之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I got zapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.62,0:28:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像听见你叫了Zeke\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said the name Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.27,0:28:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.71,0:28:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是不是还没清醒过来呢 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're still a little punchy, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.38,0:28:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,先走着再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.59,0:29:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了一个奇怪的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had the weirdest dream when I was out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.40,0:29:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好是圣诞节 我的父母还都活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Christmas, and my parents were still alive and.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.17,0:29:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.68,0:29:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie 你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, you dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.48,0:29:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.24,0:29:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有经历过死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a real hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.25,0:29:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不能算是个好猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until you've died and come back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.26,0:29:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.27,0:29:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么说我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you think I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.70,0:29:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.68,0:29:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有你梦想的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your dream life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.58,0:29:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且如果你被西方坏女巫的魔咒击中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you were zapped by the wicked witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.72,0:29:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎是即刻死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instant death.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.67,0:29:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 因为她也杀死过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would know.She killed me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.40,0:29:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.51,0:29:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们往前倒一倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's rewind here a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.95,0:29:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.61,0:29:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在奥兹的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.69,0:29:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲对学者的工作嫉妒痴迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father was obsessed with his work as a Man of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.77,0:29:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,随后我诞生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.79,0:29:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这并不能改变什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nothing changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.53,0:29:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对自己的工作闭口不谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would keep his work a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.80,0:29:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是个好奇心很重的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was such a curious kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.01,0:29:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,总能卷进各种各样的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was always looking for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.85,0:29:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找着一个又一个冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for the next big adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.57,0:29:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.63,0:29:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我悄悄尾随他去了翡翠城\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stowed away on one of his cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.26,0:29:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果在那儿受了伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wound up in the emerald city.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.96,0:30:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶然的被落在了那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accidentally got left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.14,0:30:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我真被吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.53,0:30:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.29,0:30:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遇到了三个自由的斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met up with these three freedom fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.36,0:30:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为我就是那个命中注定\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they thought I was this child of destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.23,0:30:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死西方坏女巫的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chosen to kill the wicked witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.92,0:30:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们保护了我 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}They protected me, and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.25,0:30:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫把他们变成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The witch turned them into.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.37,0:30:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,稻草人 铁皮人和一只狮子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A scarecrow, a tin man and a lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.90,0:30:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后她就开始猎杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then she hunted me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.64,0:30:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.98,0:30:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但书里可没有把这一段也写上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that never made it to the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.62,0:30:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 现实生活比小说里更加不堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes real life is darker than fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.81,0:30:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不搬进来住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why haven't you moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.12,0:30:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在真是谈这个的好时机吗 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is now really the time for this, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.52,0:30:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.28,0:30:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不像你一样有跟爸妈在一起的美好记忆 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I never had what you had with mom and dad, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.81,0:30:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.82,0:30:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有对家的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any memories of home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.65,0:30:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且每次我试图组建一个家庭的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whenever I've tried to make a home of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.76,0:30:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏事儿就会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really hasn't ended well.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.98,0:30:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但是住了一辈子破房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but a lifetime of abandoned buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.02,0:31:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,和恶心的汽车旅店\N{\fnArial\fs30}And crappy motel rooms, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.63,0:31:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿就是咱们能有的最像家的地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about as close to home as we're gonna get.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.92,0:31:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这儿是咱们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.73,0:31:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些书又是怎么回事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.62,0:31:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是被篡改了的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revisionist history.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.40,0:31:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我父亲想要记录我的经历的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my father's way of trying to undo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.01,0:31:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}What had happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.00,0:31:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I knew the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.32,0:31:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当女巫来到我的世界时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the witch came to our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.70,0:31:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成为了一个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I became a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.64,0:31:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我父亲却写了那些愚蠢的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my father wrote those silly books.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.89,0:31:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.54,0:31:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些书并不愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The books aren't silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.65,0:31:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是你父亲留给你的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're guidebooks filled with clues he left for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.63,0:31:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,学者Haggerty仔细研读了每一本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haggerty pored through each one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.13,0:31:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的研究让他找到了罂粟的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his research led him to uncover the poppies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.50,0:31:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以或许书里还有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe there's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.40,0:31:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们可以用到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the books we can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.89,0:31:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望可以找到结束女巫的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preferably something with a pointy end.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.43,0:31:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实是个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.45,0:31:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 咱们去车库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we've got to get to the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.24,0:31:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿还有个车库\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a garage in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.11,0:31:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 男孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.76,0:31:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边一切正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.06,0:32:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.08,0:32:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.79,0:32:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.51,0:32:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.04,0:32:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到女孩们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.52,0:32:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她们全杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.57,0:32:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我知道那些童子军会帮我留着它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know the boys scouts were gonna keep it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.43,0:32:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.42,0:33:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他没能挺过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.47,0:33:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要在这儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.61,0:33:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要在这儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.84,0:33:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.74,0:33:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.15,0:33:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的穿着这个走过那条金砖小路吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really walk down a brick road in these.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.12,0:33:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不其实我从来没穿过它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I never actually wore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.75,0:33:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿一个死人的鞋感觉可不怎么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seemed kind of tacky wearing a dead woman's shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.36,0:33:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 我穿高跟鞋不好看 你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, I'm no good in heels, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.30,0:33:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们大概不能直接用祈祷的方式赶走她对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose we could just wish her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.05,0:33:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 另一件书里说错的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, another thing that the book got wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.18,0:33:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 就像罂粟花一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, like the poppies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.25,0:33:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们具有奥兹的魔力\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are magic from Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.94,0:33:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,强大的魔力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharp magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.61,0:33:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,用鞋子杀死女巫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death by shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.51,0:33:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.88,0:33:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你们的蝙蝠侠嗓音吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that your Batman voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.91,0:33:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那肯定不是你们的蝙蝠侠嗓音\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's definitely not your Batman voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.25,0:33:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.17,0:33:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把他们都附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She possessed the both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.83,0:33:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你了 小美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss you, my pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.59,0:33:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二次杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing you a second time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.63,0:33:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,会像第一次一样甜蜜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will be just as sweet as the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.46,0:33:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个 我知道你们还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I know you are in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.72,0:33:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 你不能让女巫得逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you can't let the witch do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.66,0:33:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她把那个门打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she opens the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.57,0:33:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会毁掉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going to destroy us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.84,0:34:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本没想着要逃去奥兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no intention of escaping to Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.21,0:34:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把我的军队带到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to bring my armies here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.96,0:35:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 你会在死后与Dorothy相见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, you'll join the Dorothy after you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.02,0:35:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真抱歉 这可能会很痛 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about the nerves Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.98,0:35:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 我会给你争取点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, I'll buy you some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.51,0:35:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 让我看看你们的嫩脖子有多结实\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's see what you pencil necks are made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.46,0:36:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们用古老的方法来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's do this the old fashion way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.66,0:36:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的身体伤害不了你 Dorothy\N{\fnArial\fs30}My body cannot hurt you, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.49,0:36:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们的可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But theirs can.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.54,0:36:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 上鞋跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.32,0:36:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.74,0:36:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.85,0:37:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,叮咚 小贱人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ding dong, Bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.56,0:38:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的要这样吗 在我做完一切之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, after what I did with Ms.defying gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.95,0:38:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bollocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.27,0:38:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的黑美人在这儿看起来不错嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby looks good in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.79,0:38:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.74,0:38:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.64,0:38:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dorothy 我在档案馆找到了点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dorothy, I found something in the archives.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.67,0:38:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定这属于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.22,0:38:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道那有多奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea how odd it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.58,0:38:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一系列的书在写你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having a series of books writing about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.19,0:38:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I do know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.93,0:38:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那的确很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is definitely weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.72,0:38:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.43,0:38:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.31,0:38:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our story.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.60,0:38:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们书写\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we get to write it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.90,0:39:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 谢谢你们的闺蜜之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, thanks for the slumber party.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.52,0:39:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 让我死而复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And bringing me back from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.20,0:39:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.26,0:39:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟流氓耍流氓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't BS a BS-er.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.92,0:39:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在是僵尸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I a zombie now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.98,0:39:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要吃大脑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I need to eat brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.53,0:39:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 你是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, you are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.65,0:39:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.85,0:39:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 就\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, just.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.18,0:39:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事儿替我保密 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep this between us, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.06,0:39:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.66,0:39:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是因为你把我救活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only base on you bringing me back from dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.93,0:39:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你待会一定要跟我解释的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which you are going to explain to me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.33,0:39:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.21,0:39:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对一群图书管理员来说 你们还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad for a bunch of librarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.75,0:39:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意帮我照看一下我的车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind keep an eye on my bike for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.38,0:39:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的 只要你不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Yeah, as long as you don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.94,0:39:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我时不时开着它出去遛遛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking it for a spin once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.73,0:39:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.68,0:39:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们 为所有的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.46,0:39:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 请原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now if you excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.41,0:39:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有个叛乱要去处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a rebellion to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.85,0:39:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要跟我一起来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you are coming or what.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.36,0:39:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 和你 去奥兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, with you to Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.24,0:40:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你说你在寻找冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you said you are looking for adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.83,0:40:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here it is, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.13,0:40:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,来帮我找到那该死的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come Help me to find the damn dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.21,0:40:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道奥兹里有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what's in the Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.49,0:40:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说那里有会飞的猴子 女巫军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean there are flying monkeys, armies of witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.33,0:40:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,各种危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}All kinds of danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.43,0:40:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.01,0:40:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.63,0:40:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就敲鞋跟三下 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tap your heels together three times, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.09,0:40:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.93,0:40:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个疯娃子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you crazy kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.77,0:40:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没有我会好好的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna be all right without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.06,0:40:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们自己保重 男孩们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of yourself, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.37,0:41:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得她会回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think she'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.75,0:41:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 哪也没有家里好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, there's no place like home.
